    {
      "Original": "If you have any custom plugins installed, please disable them and try again. If the issue persists, please report it to the Umbra team by joining our Discord server and reporting the issue in the #support channel. Please include the following information:\n\n\t1. The error message displayed below.\n\t2. A description of what you were doing when the error occurred.\n\t3. Any steps you took to try to resolve the issue.\n\nThank you for your help!",
